<title>USA: Air &amp; Water Technologies names new CEO.</title>
<headline>Air &amp; Water Technologies names new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BRANCHBURG, N.J. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air &amp; Water Technologies Corp said Thursday it has named Robert Sheh chairman, president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Alain Houdaille, who served as interim chief executive after the death of Claudio Elia last April in the plane crash that killed Commerce Secretary Ron Brown on a trade mission to Bosnia and Croatia.</p>
<p>Most recently, Sheh served as president and chief executive of International Technology Corp.</p>
</text>
